	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Contacts for the v4 battery pack (docs/pack.md): four 2.2 mm round gold (ENIG) pads at 2.5 mm, no part and no paste. The pack's Xinyangze YZR0158-20050-04025-01 magnetic pogo male (LCSC C5126843; drawing 2022-03-24: pins at 2.50, pads 4 x 2.20) presses its pins on them at its 4.00 mm working height. Its body (21.20 x 6.86 mm, a 5.03 x 2.31 mm tab on one side, drawn at -x so that on the back, turned 180 deg, it points east) floats 1.2 mm off the board: Fab shows it; parts under it may stand up to 1.0 mm (enclosure/generate.py checks). The courtyard is only the pads' 1.4 mm keep-out. Pad 1 BAT+, 2 MID, 3 NTC, 4 BAT-. Origin = body centre.")
